Hacker's Keyboard (Dead Keys)

This is a modified version of Hacker's Keyboard
(https://github.com/klausw/hackerskeyboard), which is based on the Android
Open Source Project keyboard. The original work and this modified version are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.

Modifications made in this fork (2026):

- Build updated for current tooling: Gradle 9 wrapper, Android Gradle
  Plugin 9, compileSdk 36, minSdk 21, current NDK and CMake. GitHub Actions CI.
- Alt-based dead keys (diaeresis, acute, circumflex, tilde, grave) and ç/ß for
  physical keyboards: new DeadKeyHandler class, hooked into LatinIME key
  handling.
- Application ID changed to org.pocketworkstation.pckeyboard.deadkeys, app
  name changed to "Hacker's Keyboard (Dead Keys)", and custom intent actions
  renamed, so it can be installed alongside the original.
